ganizmu Twojego pupila. </span></p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoListParagraph\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 106%; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 106%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri;\\\">Korzyści z podawania kotu jedzenia SHEBA&reg; Selection z Kurczakiem w Sosie:</span></p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\" style=\\\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 106%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&middot;<span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\\\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 106%; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\\\">Receptura</span></strong></p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 106%; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\\\">Mistrzowsko opracowany przepis najwyższej jakości.</span></p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\" style=\\\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 106%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&middot;<span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\\\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 106%; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor